I want to create a webapp (svelte I guess) to help us with our accounting. 

- It needs to be mobile and desktop accessible. 

There will be 2 pages. The homepage only contains buttons to these 2 pages

## Reciept
Allows the user to upload a photo of a receipt to a google drive folder. 
They can
- upload an saved image on their device via file explorer
- upload multiple images via drag and drop
- take a picture with their device's camera

## Invoice
Generates an invoice with the same functionality as existing online invoice generators like https://invoice-generator.com/ except
- It uses our predefined (statically stored) company branding and layout
- Has 2 signature fields. Signatures can be saved in the cookies of the website for easy reuse.
-- The sender
-- The sendee
Either party can create the invoice. When they do, it saves it as a Partial Invoice in a google drive folder that can be accessed via a generated link for 48 hours
The other party may access a Partial Invoice via that link and finish it by signing their side, making a Completed Invoice. 
Saving a Partial or Completed invoice will overwrite it on the google drive.
If the invoice remains Partial for more than 48 hours, it is deleted from the google drive.

All files are given human-readable names on the google drive that must, at the very least, contain the date of creation
